Chart: A flexible, responsive result-bound Vega-Lite visualization. Select a useful form for the task (for example, line or area for a time trend, bar for category comparisons, arc for a small part-to-whole view, or points for relationships), and compose, facet, layer, or add a legend and result-bound tooltip when they clarify the answer. Keep axes, labels, units, and number of series readable. The spec describes presentation only and cannot supply data or executable transforms.
